        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Current U.S. leadership undermines the country’s ability to act effectively abroad.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "American values and institutions are uniquely capable of promoting global good.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts their own judgment about U.S. foreign policy effectiveness.",
        "confidence": 0.9
