  {
    "episode_id": 45336,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45336.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 53,
    "turn_text": "What do we do about organizations like the CDC and the FDA? I mean, they're not legislative bodies, but in essence, it seems like they legislate. And then it seems like, well, you just turn on any corporate news and they're all sponsored by Pfizer, sponsored by Moderna as they're doing stories on Pfizer, on Moderna. What do we do about that mess?",
