  {
    "episode_id": 45336,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45336.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 68,
    "turn_text": "Are you ever amazed that nobody gets fired from any of these organizations? I mean, two years after COVID, as far as I know, no one really at the CDC got fired. Nobody at the FDA got fired. Nobody involved at the governmental level who were pushing mandates that either were illegal, potentially illegal or at the very least immoral. The series of other things, they forced doctors out of work and then first they were essential, then they were out of work. Well, all of the nonsense that they did, but I don't know that anyone got fired. I don't know of any other business that could operate this way.",
